xample, if the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" equals \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abcde"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" equals \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"baddc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", then "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" becomes \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bbabb"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A used string disappears, but Vasya can use equal strings several times."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya wants to know for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" given strings "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":", how many ways there are to obtain from the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" using the given set of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4n"},{"kind":"text","text":" strings? Two ways are different if the number of strings used from some group of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" strings is different. Help Vasya compute the answers for these questions modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"109 + 7"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, m ≤ 500"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of groups of four strings in the set, and the length of all strings."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"c